Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Third Episode\NThe Egyptian Adventure\NPyramid Monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why your watch is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially in winter, fog rolls over these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If an enemy ship attacked under cover of it, we'd never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Days like today are the most dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a suspicious ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What country is this girl from?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.33,0:02:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing those iron rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take off these iron rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is this mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the mark of sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year, ten girls wearing these bracelets are sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me more. Where is your country located?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pursuers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Hide in that fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What country's soldiers are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Young maiden chosen for the sacrifice, why did you run?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crime is grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Princess Sapphire of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Disguising yourself as a young maiden of this land won't fool anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That bracelet you're wearing is absolute proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag the young maiden away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go! You've got the wrong person!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sick of this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake, beautiful maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to play dumb, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This large port town,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and the great triangular structures beyond the desert...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the world knows this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The big port...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and the pyramids
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Egypt, just like Dr. Uranai told me about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Egypt's premier city, Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am the Master of Ceremonies, Morpho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Morpho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Morpho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all a case of mistaken identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still trying to play dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, beautiful maiden, isn't it an honor to be sacrificed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You were chosen as a sacrifice because you are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrifices appease Osiris, the God of Death, and keep our land at peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nonsense! A kingdom can't gain peace through sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! The god Osiris and Queen Ida demand ten sacrifices!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,On the night of the next full moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,all ten of you beautiful maidens will be sacrificed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to find a way to escape...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,These iron shackles...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please adjust them so they don't hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easily done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, taking me for a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Amensis
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Amensis, the late Queen Ida's only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess of Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your noble grace and skill with a sword prove you are no ordinary maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a case of mistaken identity, I cannot decide your fate on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This kingdom is vast, and I lack authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will call a council to decide. Please wait here until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Amensis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sick of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, is that parrot good at mimicking people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey kid, is that parrot good at mimicking people?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can that parrot fly well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can that parrot fly well?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It could fly around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...around the world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit of an exaggeration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, go to my kingdom and tell Tink to come help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reward you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way is your kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the north.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, fly as fast as you can to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be buried alive along with these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness! Prince Amensis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you please release me, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness! What's going to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be sacrificed as well. It has been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's absurd...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You are taking the place of the young maiden who fled to your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you are the sacrifices to be offered to the spirit of the late Queen Ida.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Ida was said to be the second most beautiful woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,, right after Cleopatra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.31,0:09:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in death,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,she retains her youth and beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:10:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,sleeping mummified deep within the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But the mummy's youth and beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,will fade unless you, the sacrifices, offer yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To take ten lives every year over something like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Superstition?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Highness! As young as you are, do you really believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just believing what Morpho taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a sacrifice, your mother's mummy will hideously decay,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and the curse of Osiris, God of Death, will fall upon the Kingdom of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lying, Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be sacrificed in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, enjoy yourself in this palace to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I, Sapphire am not going to die like this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:10:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And Tink didn't show up today, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.97,0:11:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you crying or trying to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was chosen because I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you born just to be buried alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we have to escape somehow. If we fight, I know we can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire... Tink... It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Amensis...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,there is one way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is... That is to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you marry me, you won't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Sapphire, refuse to be the only one saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have only three days left to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be awaiting your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The news must not have reached you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful sacrifices, the night of the full moon has come. Are you prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Reaper Osiris, deliver these sacrifices to the realm of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And transfer their beauty to the mummy of Queen Ida!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Queen Ida, remain beautiful forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Queen Ida, remain young forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead people can't become young or beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear Osiris, the god of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no god of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Has she gone mad with fear of being sacrificed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, take the sacrifices away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To the pyramid where Queen Ida slumbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, please hear my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this ring and become my wife, and you will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:14:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, listen to me. Become my wife, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Amensis...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you ask, I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not the kind of girl who would be happy saving only myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once we're trapped inside... It's all over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:15:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is awful!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I am a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the courage to face Morpho or Osiris to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry out my will as you move forward! Understood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools, even after I warned them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The pyramid is full of traps to ward off thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,O Osiris, God of Death, accept this sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That shall be your grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods, save us! I'm so scared! I'm afraid to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you girls all beauty and no courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, cheer up and be brave. There must be an exit somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the pyramid is a giant maze,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there's bound to be at least one opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, this is awful...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We really don't need crocodiles now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pincer attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet even this kid will sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe around 300 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, that's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,300 yen? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're slave traders. Even you can sell for 300 yen. Have some confidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to sell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go save Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought there'd be a secret exit somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use. We've been captured by Osiris, the god of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Osiris, sacrifices... it's all just superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.39,0:20:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying won't make the mummies look any prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that! Lord Osiris's curse is terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,M-M-M-Mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:21:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret exit! Escape through there! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the exit! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Morfo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, slave trader,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,this batch of female slaves gave us a hard time, all because of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A slaver trader...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a lineup of beauties this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a good price for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year, claiming they were sacrifices, you gathered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful maidens from across the land and kidnapped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You were selling them off to slave traders!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reaper of Osiris, preserving the mummy's beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I set it all up brilliantly, if I say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tie up the slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.36,0:22:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stuffing me into a mustard pot is so cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.48,0:22:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm caught, I can't save Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do... what should I do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, forgive me for picking on these camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Rakuda-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.55,0:22:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.61,0:22:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, Morpho!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:22:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.02,0:23:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Morpho, now is the time to stand up to superstition!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.87,0:23:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've grown stronger thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best to make our country just as great as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,
